-- Import of PF 2025 official exam items for the career "Papiloscopista
-- Policial Federal" (Edital nº 1 – PF – Policial, de 20 de maio de 2025,
-- retificado pelo Edital nº 9, de 16/09/2025; CONCURSO PÚBLICO PARA
-- PROVIMENTO DE VAGAS NOS CARGOS DE DELEGADO DE POLÍCIA FEDERAL, PERITO
-- CRIMINAL FEDERAL, ESCRIVÃO DE POLÍCIA FEDERAL, AGENTE DE POLÍCIA FEDERAL
-- E PAPILOSCOPISTA POLICIAL FEDERAL; banca CEBRASPE; prova aplicada
-- 27/07/2025). This is a NEW contest edition (2025), distinct from the
-- 2021 Papiloscopista edition already imported by
-- 20260929260000_pf_2021_papiloscopista_import.sql.
--
-- The exam booklet for this cargo is assembled from three shared/specific
-- blocks, each with its own PDF and gabarito, read verbatim from Google
-- Drive this session:
--   - CB2 (Conhecimentos Básicos - Bloco I, itens 1-60), shared with other
--     cargos of this concurso: prova fileId 1oYY4L2FMusSyNcMxoegVSD3GrMndqTm3
--     (106_PF_CB2_01.pdf), gabarito fileId 1ok6hmVmB1AmARAz-n8P6paBKSIXUphq6
--     (106_PF_25_GabaritosDefinitivos.xlsm extract, sheet
--     "CONHECIMENTOS BÁSICOS – BLOCO I – PARA OS CARGOS 15, 16 E 17").
--   - CG1 (Conhecimentos Básicos - Bloco II - TI, itens 61-96), shared with
--     other cargos: prova fileId 1sSrIZQq0hR50td0UcNlsDK1fnpmTxV3Q
--     (106_PF_CG1_01.pdf), gabarito fileId 15rFd8qPjUeikGc_bty6HzDAQF5b6qVOr
--     (sheet "CONHECIMENTOS BÁSICOS – BLOCO II – PARA OS CARGOS 15, 16 E 17").
--   - Prova específica (Conhecimentos Específicos - Bloco III, itens
--     97-120), exclusive to this cargo: prova fileId
--     1-zA39Prnh2-yd88M6DMJQrd2Mo4jp7pY (106_PF_017_01.pdf), gabarito fileId
--     1r4D_pKBnox1v1IQwS-D7ZOnwretXL13q (sheet "CARGO 17: PAPILOSCOPISTA
--     POLICIAL FEDERAL").
-- All three prova PDFs and all three gabarito extracts were read in full
-- this session; the 120 items (1-120) form a single contiguous, non-
-- overlapping sequence: CB2 covers 1-60, CG1 covers 61-96, and the cargo
-- specific booklet covers 97-120.
--
-- content_sources for CB2 and CG1 use URL strings keyed to their Google
-- Drive fileId so that the Escrivão/Agente 2025 sibling imports running in
-- parallel against the SAME shared CB2/CG1 blocks land on the same rows via
-- ON CONFLICT (url) DO NOTHING, instead of duplicating content_sources.
--
-- Discipline breakdown derived directly from reading each prova's own
-- section headers/command blocks: Língua Portuguesa (1-8), Redação Oficial
-- (9-10), Direito Administrativo (11-16), Direito Constitucional (17-22),
-- Direito Penal (23-25, 28), Direito Processual Penal (26-27), Direitos
-- Humanos/Regras de Mandela (29-32), Direito Internacional (33-34),
-- Legislação Penal Especial (35, 37-39), Legislação Especial - Segurança
-- Pública e Identificação Civil (36, 40-43), Direito Ambiental (44),
-- Estatística e Probabilidade (45-52), Raciocínio Lógico-Matemático
-- (53-60), Informática (61-96), and, distinctively for this cargo, the
-- Conhecimentos Específicos block: Biologia Aplicada à Papiloscopia
-- (97-104), Física Aplicada à Papiloscopia (105-112) and Química Aplicada
-- à Papiloscopia (113-120).
--
-- OCR/extraction caveat: items 105, 106, 107 and 110 (Física) embed inline
-- mathematical formulas/subscripts that the Google Drive text extraction of
-- the source PDF did not recover cleanly (corrupted/placeholder glyphs in
-- the text layer). Per CONTENT_GOVERNANCE.md's ban on inventing content,
-- this migration does NOT reconstruct or guess those formulas: question_text
-- keeps the verbatim surrounding prose and marks the unresolved formula
-- spans with an explicit bracketed note, and each such row's review_note
-- flags it for mandatory manual verification against the original PDF
-- images before any use beyond internal review.
--
-- Reuses the (contest_name,career_name,exam_year,item_number) unique
-- constraint on official_exam_questions already widened by
-- 20260929240000_pf_2021_delegado_import.sql.

insert into public.content_sources (source_type,title,issuer,url,status,notes) values
